    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk, i dont know if \"the struggle\" is enough to make it worth it. it just feels like we're being told to run a marathon on a treadmill that's eventually going to break. if the outcome is always zero, then the effort feels like a lie. it feels like we're just prolonging the inevitable for no reason. why is \"the struggle\" actually good if it changes nothing in the end?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
